fect on dispatch_allocated. So dispatch_allocated stays true. Similarly for execute_destination_dispatch and execute_schedule_dispatch: effect includes (dispatched ?candidate) (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit) (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot). No effect on dispatch_allocated. So dispatch_allocated remains true after dispatch. Good.

